:{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description"}}]}},"showLessCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CL4BEM2rARgBIhMI6_-plParlgMVnqAKCB2RzjHhygEECGe84g==","changeEngagementPanelVisibilityAction":{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description","visibility":"ENGAGEMENT_PANEL_VISIBILITY_HIDDEN"}},"attributedDescription":{"content":"Congratulations to Manchester City - another FA Cup in the bag for Pep Guardiola's men as they pull off a memorable Cup Double. And with three key games still to go this GW, they might yet beat Arsenal to the title to claim a treble. \n\n\nFPL points tough to come by this week, as Dominic Calvert-Lewin wipes out the Brighton clean sheet at the death and Thiago blanks for Brentford - so maybe we should've all just stuck with Watkins and Rogers. Both highly sold before the GW, including by Sam, only for them to punish the sellers with a resounding win against Liverpool.\n\n\nA massive THANK YOU for all your support watching, liking and sharing our videos!\n\n\n__________________________\n 🚀 Support FPL Family on Patreon:\n\n\n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Exclusive FREE Podcasts every week looking ahead to the next GW\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Manager of the Month Competitions  - MONTHLY PRIZES!\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Zoom Video Chats with Lee and Sam\n     \n     \n     \n  •  \n     \n     Slack Chat community with other FPL Managers\n     \n     \n     \n\nJoin for FREE or Support the Channel!\n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \n________________________\n 📊 Join the FPLFamily FPL Mini-League!\n5162cw\n________________________\n🎧 Also available as a Podcast on your favourite Podcast platforms!\n  (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...)  / fplfamily   (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \nhttps://audioboom.com/channels/5010221 (https://www.youtube.com/redirect?even...) \nSearch 'FPL Family' on Spotify, Apple iTunes,  Deez